{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailNoStillBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailNoStillBody", "text": "This reads beat timing only from the seconds you were not moving, and the last {days, plural, one{{days} day} other{{days} days}} had too few of them to build an hour from.", "sha256": "c508745e478df23bef36677ff965b16e38a841ae26d402f0f9320e2f75839dba", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailStillnessTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailStillnessTitle", "text": "Beat-to-beat variability while still", "sha256": "6919be53eacfe208d2c8a81410fd8b4402d358348fdc4bbb4ed4f8ebf00b3ec5", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailStillnessFootnote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailStillnessFootnote", "text": "Each hour is the middle value of {lo}–{hi} five-minute stretches you were actually still, over the last {days, plural, one{{days} day} other{{days} days}} — never today's alone. {drawn} of 24 hours had at least three stretches; the rest are blank. Not a stress score — sitting up, a warm room or a coffee move it just as much.", "sha256": "7d4ebfcaa74737e92deec1421d9dc1463192c76c21fd1a8955eb9baeda562fc5", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailForecastTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailForecastTitle", "text": "How today is likely to run", "sha256": "aeaacf64fca3e2379c01265110d70b20298d0baeb612be053ffb912a1ccac5dd", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailForecastFootnote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailForecastFootnote", "text": "No scale — the shape is the whole output.", "sha256": "97eb143533a34df97ffc5f564b5297afa92d2dab7575c458e5636f9f3968c524", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailTroughText", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailTroughText", "text": "The flattest stretch lands in {troughLabel}, around {start}–{end}.", "sha256": "cdf843e1e2d093d028a1831191dae348ddfa08af436ec3d1ab6ca8040cefae4b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailPredictionDisclaimer", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailPredictionDisclaimer", "text": "This is a prediction, not a reading. Nothing on the band measures how alert you are, and it knows last night and nothing else — a nap, coffee, or anything that happens today never reaches it.", "sha256": "54e8defb6b11d47a3642c282820f28a09ab82e57e705176892d489bcbe7b81d4", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailAssumedPhaseNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailAssumedPhaseNote", "text": "Your own clock peak is not worked out yet, so this uses an average one.", "sha256": "a436d6de85b8e5c44e4ed4886b262a446e381421f84bc458e964400c0be41126", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:circadianDetailNotADrivingCheck", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "circadianDetailNotADrivingCheck", "text": "It is not a fitness-to-drive check and not a shift-safety tool, and it does not say you are impaired.", "sha256": "42553e55d6695205d922819bb88aedb663ec0ac78dce70ae243786378cfc5e72", "kind": "arb"}
